4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>\ud83c\udff9 Archery</strong><br>Shoot arrows at the target and try to hit as close to the center as you can.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2335250/extras/16ccbb23e3e62a155f818019d17b5104.poster.avif?t=1740838151\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2335250/extras/16ccbb23e3e62a155f818019d17b5104.webm?t=1740838151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2335250/extras/16ccbb23e3e62a155f818019d17b5104.mp4?t=1740838151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Are you ready prove your skills? Dive into Mini Sports now and let the games begin!",
